---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ContactList from '../components/ContactList.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';

const description = 'Beastry 是做开源 macOS 工具的社区。母品牌是书与粉兔、蓝猫、黄熊。';
const descriptionEn =
  'Beastry is a community that makes open-source Mac apps. The mother brand is a book with a pink rabbit, a blue cat, and a yellow bear.';
---

<Base title="关于" titleEn="About" description={description} descriptionEn={descriptionEn}>
  <article class="page">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="kicker"><span lang="zh-Hans">关于</span><span lang="en">About</span></p>
      <h1><span lang="zh-Hans">关于 Beastry</span><span lang="en">About Beastry</span></h1>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        Beastry 做开源的 macOS 工具，也收下一件作品的想法。家在
        <a href={site.url}>beastry.app</a>。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        Beastry makes open-source Mac apps, and collects ideas for what to make next. Home is
        <a href={site.url}>beastry.app</a>.
      </p>

      <h2><span lang="zh-Hans">母品牌</span><span lang="en">The mother brand</span></h2>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        标志是打开的书，书上是粉兔、蓝猫和黄熊。它代表 Beastry，不是某一款应用的图标。Stow、MijiaBar、Octoshot 用它们自己的标志。还没核实到标志的项目，页面上留空。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        The mark is an open book with a pink rabbit, a blue cat, and a yellow bear. It stands for Beastry, not for one app. Stow, MijiaBar, and Octoshot use their own marks. A project without a verified mark is left blank.
      </p>

      <h2><span lang="zh-Hans">现在有什么</span><span lang="en">What is here now</span></h2>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        Stow、MijiaBar、Octoshot 在公测，介绍页是
        <a href="/stow/">/stow</a>、<a href="/mijiabar/">/mijiabar</a>、<a href="/octoshot/">/octoshot</a>。AgentKey、Splatty、LetterBee 还在开发，没有安装包。记忆面包在本站标为搁置；它的 README 自己没有写“已搁置”。完整名单在
        <a href="/projects">作品</a>。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        Stow, MijiaBar, and Octoshot are in public beta. AgentKey, Splatty, and LetterBee are still in development and have no installer. 记忆面包 is listed here as on hold; its own README does not say that. The full list is on
        <a href="/projects">Works</a>.
      </p>

      <h2><span lang="zh-Hans">一起做</span><span lang="en">Making things together</span></h2>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        新想法提交到 <a href={site.ideaIssue} rel="noreferrer">Beastry/ideas</a>。已有产品的问题和建议从 <a href="/help">帮助</a> 进各自仓库。怎么读这些记录、谁来点合并，写在 <a href="/community">参与</a> 和 <a href="/agents">Agent 说明</a>。本站第一方源码和原创文档以
        <a href="https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html" rel="noreferrer">GPL-3.0-only</a>
        提供，见本仓库 LICENSE。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        New ideas go to <a href={site.ideaIssue} rel="noreferrer">Beastry/ideas</a>. Problems and suggestions for an existing product start at <a href="/help">Help</a>. How those records are read, and who merges, is on <a href="/community">Take part</a> and <a href="/agents">For agents</a>. First-party source and original docs on this site are
        <a href="https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html" rel="noreferrer">GPL-3.0-only</a>. See this repository’s LICENSE.
      </p>

      <h2><span lang="zh-Hans">安全</span><span lang="en">Security</span></h2>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">
        如果发现漏洞，请寄到 <a href="mailto:security@beastry.app">security@beastry.app</a>。AgentKey 的 README 写明尚未经过安全审计，使用前请读它自己的说明。
      </p>
      <p lang="en">
        If you find a vulnerability, email security@beastry.app. AgentKey’s README says it has not had a security audit. Read that note before you rely on it.
      </p>

      <h2><span lang="zh-Hans">联系</span><span lang="en">Contact</span></h2>
      <ContactList />
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
